  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRI LANKA STRENGTHENING GOVERNMENT PROCUREMENT CAPACITY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IDF grant would support activities already initiated by GOSL under the agreed action plan based on CPAR recommendations, with a view to improving efficiency, transparency and effectiveness in public procurement, through: (1).   Public Advocacy and Awareness on Procurement Reform; (2).   Improvement of the Procedural and Legal Framework; (3).   Training and Skills Enhancement; and (4).   Introduction of  Effective Procurement Monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
